\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf3 Instead of fixing OCR upstream, fix it downstream:\
Normalize:\
\pard\tx220\tx520\pardeftab720\li520\fi-520\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \uc0\u1571 , \u1573 , \u1570  \u8594  \u1575 \
\ls7\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \uc0\u1609  \u8594  \u1610 \
\ls7\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \uc0\u1577  \u8594  \u1607  (context-dependent)\
\ls7\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone remove tatweel (\uc0\u1600 )\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\cf3 Fix common OCR errors:\
\pard\tx220\tx520\pardeftab720\li520\fi-520\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \uc0\u1604  \u8596  \u1604 \u1575  confusion\
\ls8\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \uc0\u1576 /\u1578 /\u1579  misclassification\
\ls8\ilvl0\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone punctuation drift\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0
